				<h3 class="tl-title">US Cyber Challenge</h3>
				<p class="tl-org">Cyber Quests</p>
				<p class="tl-desc">Competed in 3 US Cyber Challenge competitions. Ranked 42nd internationally most recently. <a href="https://www.uscyberchallenge.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">USCC Website</a></p>
